    "Hides the last half of each MAC on screen and in sit reports. Coordinates show as masked, and street names are left out. The vendor prefix stays. Logs, matching, and Hunt still use the real address and position. The TAK feed pauses so those are not sent. The Path map still loads if Online place names and maps is on. Turn this off when you need the full address on screen." to "在屏幕和记录报告中隐藏每个 MAC 的后半部分。坐标显示为已遮蔽，并省略街道名称。厂商前缀保留。日志、匹配和猎踪仍使用真实地址和位置。TAK 数据流会暂停以免外发。开启“在线地名与地图”时路径地图仍会加载。需要在屏幕上看到完整地址时请关闭此开关。",
    "Hiding 1 flood radio" to "正在隐藏 1 个泛洪设备",
    "Hiding sitting access points until the next Wi-Fi scan. New Bluetooth still shows right away." to "隐藏已存在的热点直至下一次 Wi-Fi 扫描。新蓝牙设备仍即时显示。",
    "High performance" to "高性能",
    "Hits" to "命中",
    "Host" to "主机",
    "How long a spot stays" to "标记保留时长",
    "How long the mark stays" to "标记保留时长",
    "How loud here (RSSI)" to "此处信号强度 (RSSI)",
    "How often it advertises" to "广播间隔",
    "Hunt" to "猎踪",
    "Hunt is BLE only. Wi-Fi access points update too slowly on stock Android to walk toward." to "猎踪仅支持 BLE。原生 Android 上热点更新太慢，无法用于接近。",
    "I have read this and I agree" to "我已阅读并同意",
    "Identity" to "身份",
    "If that does not explain it, tap Copy and send the paste." to "如果这不能说明问题，请点按“复制”并发送粘贴内容。",
    "If this stays 0, Location is not updating (use high accuracy)." to "如果保持为 0，说明定位未更新（请使用高精度模式）。",
    "If this stays at 0 while you drive, set Location to high accuracy." to "开车时若保持为 0，请将定位设为高精度。",
    "Import" to "导入",
    "Import settings?" to "导入设置？",
    "Import settings…" to "导入设置…",
    "Interference can also be caused by other nearby electronics, such as Wi-Fi routers." to "附近的电子设备（如 Wi-Fi 路由器）也可能造成干扰。",
    "Invert gain" to "反转增益",
    "Jump to new watched detection" to "自动滚动到新的关注探测",
    "Keep screen on" to "保持屏幕常亮",
    "Keeps the GPS receiver awake instead of letting it rest. Uses more battery. Android 12 and newer. Older phones ignore this." to "保持 GPS 接收器唤醒而不休眠，更耗电。仅 Android 12 及以上，旧机型忽略。",
    "Kind" to "类型",
    "LAN multicast" to "局域网组播",
    "Label" to "标签",
    "Language" to "语言",
    "Last 15 minutes" to "最近 15 分钟",
    "Last 15 minutes still in memory" to "最近 15 分钟仍在内存中",
    "Last 15 minutes · solid bars are on-air windows" to "最近 15 分钟 · 实心条为在发时段",
    "Last 15 minutes. Walk with Tag detections with GPS on, or start a sit to keep a longer path." to "最近 15 分钟。开启“GPS 标记探测”并走动，或开始一条记录以保留更长路径。",
    "Last fix" to "最近定位",
    "Last heard" to "最近侦听",
