    "Laying out debrief PDF…" to "正在排版复盘 PDF…",
    "Laying out sit compare PDF…" to "正在排版记录对比 PDF…",
    "Learning the Wi-Fi that is already here." to "正在学习现场已有的 Wi-Fi。",
    "Leaves unmatched Bluetooth radios that keep changing address out of the Debrief lists. The counts still include them. Extra attention, named signatures, bookmarks, and radios that sent a position stay. Sit export still has every radio." to "将不断更换地址的未匹配蓝牙设备排除在复盘列表之外。计数仍包含它们。“额外关注”、已命名签名、收藏以及发送过位置的设备会保留。记录导出仍包含所有设备。",
    "Length" to "长度",
    "Live" to "实时",
    "Live logging is paused until this finishes. Scanning continues." to "完成前实时记录暂停。扫描继续。",
    "Live only. Signatures still label, log, and can beep. Pick Show only or Hide these, then the classes. Show only with nothing picked leaves Live unchanged. Save current as… keeps this as a preset." to "仅影响实时页。签名仍会标注、记录并可提示音。先选“仅显示”或“隐藏这些”，再选类别。“仅显示”未选任何类别时实时页不变。“当前保存为…”可存为预设。",
    "Live row" to "实时行",
    "Live scrolls to a new watched radio so you can see the flash. Turn this off if you do not want the list to move." to "实时页会滚动到新关注的设备以便看到闪烁。不希望列表移动请关闭。",
    "Live shows bookmarked signatures, and named radios with Alert on. Hide these still applies. A name with no bookmark stays under Named radios only." to "实时页显示收藏的签名和已开启警报的命名设备。“隐藏这些”仍然生效。未收藏的命名设备仅显示在“仅显示已命名设备”之下。",
    "Live shows radios you named. Alert can be off. A radio that changes its address will not keep that name." to "实时页显示你命名的设备。警报可关闭。更换地址的设备不会保留名称。",
    "Live → Start over clears the path so you can test again." to "实时 → 重新开始会清除路径以便重测。",
    "Loading map tiles…" to "正在加载地图瓦片…",
    "Location" to "位置",
    "Location is off. Android will not return Wi-Fi or Bluetooth results." to "定位已关闭。Android 不会返回 Wi-Fi 或蓝牙结果。",
    "Location, nearby Wi-Fi, Bluetooth scan, and notifications let Fieldwatch passively watch advertised networks and BLE devices. Nothing is transmitted." to "位置、附近 Wi-Fi、蓝牙扫描和通知权限让 Fieldwatch 被动监听广播网络和 BLE 设备。不会发送任何数据。",
    "Log cleared" to "日志已清除",
    "Log export" to "日志导出",
    "Log saved" to "日志已保存",
    "Logging" to "日志",
    "Logging is off. Scanning still runs. Nothing new is written until you turn this on." to "日志已关闭。扫描仍在进行。开启前不会有新内容写入。",
    "Logging is on. New detections are added to the file." to "日志已开启。新探测到的设备会写入文件。",
    "Logging paused · preparing file…" to "日志暂停 · 正在准备文件…",
    "Logging paused · saving to the location you picked…" to "日志暂停 · 正在保存到所选位置…",
    "Looking up place names…" to "正在查询地名…",
    "Loudest this hunt  —" to "本次猎踪最响  —",
    "Low waits for a deeper drop. High alerts on a smaller drop, including some routers." to "“低”等待更深的跌落。“高”在较小跌落时即警报，包括部分路由器。",
    "MAC address" to "MAC 地址",
