    "Manufacturer ID" to "厂商 ID",
    "Manufacturer data" to "厂商数据",
    "Map cleartext BLE bytes after this signature matches. Encrypted ads stay hex." to "在此签名匹配后映射明文 BLE 字节。加密广播保持十六进制。",
    "Mark seen" to "标记已见",
    "Mark seen and Reset seen appear on Live while this is on." to "开启时“标记已见”和“重置已见”显示在实时页。",
    "Mark seen and Reset seen are on Live, above the tabs." to "“标记已见”和“重置已见”位于实时页标签上方。",
    "Marked as yours. No beep while this is on. Still listed." to "标记为你的设备。开启时不提示音，仍会列出。",
    "Match any rule (OR)" to "匹配任一规则（或）",
    "Matched signatures" to "匹配的签名",
    "Matches hidden SSIDs" to "匹配隐藏 SSID",
