    "Min peers (0 = off)" to "最小对端数（0 = 关闭）",
    "Mine" to "我的",
    "Modulo" to "取模",
    "More" to "更多",
    "More display options below" to "更多显示选项见下方",
    "Moving with you" to "与你同行",
    "Moving with you needs Settings → Tag detections with GPS, then a walk or drive." to "“与你同行”需要在设置中开启“GPS 标记探测”，然后步行或驾车。",
    "Moving with you uses BLE only. Both and Wi-Fi only stay unavailable until you turn that switch off." to "“与你同行”仅用 BLE。关闭该开关前，“两者”和“仅 Wi-Fi”不可用。",
