    "New signature" to "新建签名",
    "Newest alert" to "最新警报",
    "Newest arrival" to "最新到达",
    "Newest heard" to "最新侦听",
    "Night mode" to "夜间模式",
    "No advertised name" to "无广播名称",
    "No alerts with a GPS stamp on this path." to "此路径上没有带 GPS 标记的警报。",
    "No internet" to "无网络",
    "No internet. Use Import signatures from a file." to "无网络。请使用“从文件导入签名”。",
    "No live emitters match the current filter. If this just emptied, the OS may be between scan windows — the last set is held and should return without a burst." to "没有在发设备匹配当前筛选。如果列表刚清空，系统可能正处于扫描间歇 — 上一批设备仍保留，通常无需突发即可恢复。",
    "No live emitters match the current filter. If this just emptied, the OS may be between scan windows — the last set is held and should return without a burst. Use Timeline for recent disappearances." to "没有在发设备匹配当前筛选。如果列表刚清空，系统可能正处于扫描间歇 — 上一批设备仍保留，通常无需突发即可恢复。最近消失的设备请用“时间线”查看。",
    "No loud BLE has stayed with you along this path. Wi-Fi access points stay hidden. A tag in your bag or car should show. Find My MAC rotation will not stitch." to "此路径上没有一直伴随你的响亮 BLE。Wi-Fi 热点保持隐藏。包内或车内的追踪器应能显示。“查找”类应用的 MAC 轮换无法拼接。",
    "No loud BLE has stayed with you along this path. Wi-Fi access points stay hidden. Radios marked Mine stay off this list." to "此路径上没有一直伴随你的响亮 BLE。Wi-Fi 热点保持隐藏。标记为“我的”的设备不在此列表。",
    "No loud BLE has stayed with you among the radios still allowed." to "在仍被允许的设备中，没有一直伴随你的响亮 BLE。",
    "No matching radio on the air. Save anyway; detail will fill in when one is heard." to "没有匹配设备在发。仍可保存；听到后详情会补全。",
    "No named radios on the air. Set a custom name on detail, or turn off Filters → Named radios only." to "没有已命名设备在发。请在详情中设置自定义名称，或关闭筛选 → 仅显示已命名设备。",
    "No named radios. Set a custom name on detail, or bookmark a radio (top-right) to watch it." to "没有已命名设备。请在详情中设置自定义名称，或收藏设备（右上角）以关注。",
    "No observer notes" to "无观察笔记",
    "No radio selected." to "未选择设备。",
    "No saved sits." to "没有已存记录。",
    "No signature families in this log. Randomized addresses and house-like names are skipped. A candidate needs a unique on-air ID on two or more radios." to "此日志中没有签名家族。随机地址和类家居名已跳过。候选需要至少两台设备共享同一独特的在发 ID。",
    "No sit is running. Path and Debrief use the last 15 minutes until you start one." to "没有进行中的记录。开始前，路径和复盘使用最近 15 分钟。",
    "No sit is running. Path and Debrief use the sit you pick." to "没有进行中的记录。路径和复盘使用你选择的记录。",
    "No stock rows changed." to "内置条目未更改。",
    "No watched radios on the air. Bookmark a signature, turn Alert on a Named radio, or turn off Filters → Watched only." to "没有关注的设备在发。请收藏签名、为命名设备开启警报，或关闭筛选 → 仅显示关注。",
    "No — broadcast-only (you can hear it, not join it from this scan)" to "否 — 仅广播（可听到，但此扫描无法接入）",
    "None" to "无",
    "North is up. The line is this phone, with times along it. Black is the start. Blue is you. One icon is one radio. A number is several radios in one spot. A thick green stretch is a stay. An advertised position is the last one that radio sent. A red diamond is where this phone was during a GNSS detection." to "上为北。线代表本手机，沿线标注时间。黑色是起点，蓝色是你。一个图标是一台设备；数字表示同一位置有多台设备。粗绿段表示停留。广播位置是该设备最后发送的位置。红色菱形是 GNSS 探测期间本手机所在位置。",
    "Not available" to "不可用",
    "Not in the Bluetooth company list" to "不在蓝牙公司列表中",
    "Not now" to "暂不",
    "Not on the air. This is the last detail we heard." to "已停止发射。这是最后一次听到的详情。",
    "Not this session" to "非本次会话",
    "Note" to "备注",
    "Notes" to "笔记",
    "Nothing is marked seen yet." to "尚无标记为已见的设备。",
    "Nothing is sent to a Fieldwatch server." to "不会发送任何数据到 Fieldwatch 服务器。",
    "Nothing parsed. Check offset, length, and that byte 0 is after the company ID." to "未解析出内容。请检查偏移、长度，以及字节 0 是否在公司 ID 之后。",
    "Now" to "此刻",
    "OK" to "确定",
    "OUI (vendor prefix)" to "OUI（厂商前缀）",
    "Observer notes" to "观察笔记",
    "Observer notes cleared" to "观察笔记已清除",
    "Observer notes saved" to "观察笔记已保存",
    "Off" to "关闭",
    "Off sends nothing. While alerting sends during a hit at or above Alert from." to "关闭时不发送。“警报时”在命中达到“警报触发于”级别时发送。",
    "Off — Stale after only" to "关闭 — 仅“过期后”",
    "Off. Android is limiting Wi-Fi scans to about four per two minutes. Tap the switch to open Developer options." to "已关闭。Android 正在把 Wi-Fi 扫描限制为约每两分钟 4 次。点按开关打开开发者选项。",
    "Offline, Debrief keeps the coordinates and Path stays a plain trace." to "离线时，复盘保留坐标，路径保持纯轨迹。",
    "Offset" to "偏移",
    "On the air — tap to open detail" to "在发 — 点按打开详情",
    "On. A new access-point list about every 8 seconds. Uses more battery. This matches Wi-Fi scan throttling in Developer options." to "已开启。约每 8 秒刷新一次热点列表，更耗电。与开发者选项中的 Wi-Fi 扫描节流设置对应。",
    "One MAC each. Custom name shows on Live. Mine marks it as yours: no beep while on, still listed. Observer notes show on detail and reports. Alert is optional (pip / voice / flash). Filters → Named radios only hides everything else. Signature watches stay on Signatures." to "每个对应一个 MAC。自定义名称显示在实时页。“我的”表示这是你的设备：开启时不提示音，但仍会列出。观察笔记显示在详情和报告中。警报可选（提示音 / 语音 / 闪烁）。筛选 → 仅显示已命名设备 会隐藏其他所有设备。签名关注仍在“签名”中。",
    "One row per radio in this sit, or the last 15 minutes. Not the log. CSV and JSON include the matched signatures. GPX and KML include this phone’s path and a point for each detection. Fieldwatch does not upload the file. Privacy mode does not hide addresses in it." to "此记录（或最近 15 分钟）内每台设备一行，不是日志。CSV 和 JSON 包含匹配的签名。GPX 和 KML 包含本手机路径及每个探测点。Fieldwatch 不上传该文件。隐私模式也不会隐去其中的地址。",
    "Online place names and maps" to "在线地名与地图",
    "Only if" to "仅当",
    "Only if…" to "仅当…",
    "Open Android settings" to "打开 Android 设置",
    "Open developer options" to "打开开发者选项",
    "Opens a paste-ready prompt for a chat: decode this radio, look up OUI/company/UUIDs, and say what it most likely is. Same experimental disclaimer as Settings → AI Export. One device only — not identity." to "生成可粘贴到聊天中的提示词：解码此设备、查询 OUI/公司/UUID，并说明它最可能是什么。与设置 → AI 导出 相同的实验性免责声明。仅限单台设备 — 非身份确认。",
    "Opens the same battery page. Choose Unrestricted. On some phones, including Samsung, tap Allow background usage first, then choose Unrestricted." to "打开同一电池页面。选择“不受限制”。部分手机（如三星）需先点“允许后台运行”，再选“不受限制”。",
    "Opens this app’s battery page. Turn on Allow background usage there. If it is off, Android can stop the scan when you leave." to "打开本应用的电池页面。在其中开启“允许后台运行”。若关闭，离开应用时 Android 可能停止扫描。",
    "Optional. After this signature matches, map cleartext BLE bytes to labels. Encrypted payloads stay hex." to "可选。此签名匹配后，将明文 BLE 字节映射为标签。加密载荷保持十六进制。",
    "Optional. Byte 0 is the first byte after the company ID. Empty = any record." to "可选。字节 0 指公司 ID 后的第一个字节。留空 = 任意记录。",
    "Optional. If this is not empty, matching radios get a “!” on Live, this amber card on detail, and a line in Debrief. Separate from Notes above." to "可选。非空时，匹配设备在实时页标“!”，详情页显示琥珀色卡片，并在复盘中记一行。与上方“笔记”独立。",
    "Paste this into an issue. It has no network names, no addresses, and no GPS coordinates." to "将此内容粘贴到 issue。不含网络名称、地址或 GPS 坐标。",
    "Path" to "路径",
    "Pattern catalog." to "模式目录。",
    "Pattern match, not identity. Not a safety finding." to "模式匹配而非身份确认。非安全结论。",
    "Pause" to "暂停",
    "Pause display" to "暂停显示",
    "Payload location" to "载荷位置",
    "Payload location sends Remote ID and any radio that advertises its own coordinates." to "“载荷位置”发送 Remote ID 及任何自报坐标的设备。",
    "Peer window (seconds)" to "对端窗口（秒）",
    "Periodic advertising" to "周期广播",
    "Phone, Android version, the scan switches, and whether Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, and Location are on. Copy pastes that into an issue. Network names and GPS coordinates are left out." to "手机型号、Android 版本、扫描开关，以及 Wi-Fi、蓝牙和定位是否开启。点“复制”可粘贴到 issue。不含网络名称和 GPS 坐标。",
    "Pick a map format." to "请选择地图格式。",
    "Pick a second sit." to "选择第二条记录。",
    "Pick which radios Live shows. One radio is Wi-Fi or BLE, not both." to "选择实时页显示的设备类型。一类设备是 Wi-Fi 或 BLE，不可兼得。",
    "Please wait…" to "请稍候…",
    "Port" to "端口",
    "Preparing sit export…" to "正在准备记录导出…",
    "Presence (15 min)" to "在场（15 分钟）",
    "Presets" to "预设",
    "Presets you saved stay. Live shows the radios again. This cannot be undone." to "已保存的预设保留。实时页重新显示设备。此操作无法撤销。",
    "Preview" to "预览",
    "Privacy mode" to "隐私模式",
    "Privacy mode is on, so the feed is paused. Turn Privacy mode off to send markers." to "隐私模式已开启，数据流已暂停。关闭隐私模式以发送标记。",
    "Privacy mode is on. Debrief, Compare, and AI Export hide the last half of each MAC, the coordinates, and a Remote ID id. The log and sit export still have the full addresses and coordinates." to "隐私模式已开启。复盘、对比和 AI 导出会隐去每个 MAC 的后半部分、坐标和 Remote ID。日志和记录导出仍包含完整地址和坐标。",
    "RSSI bars" to "RSSI 条",
    "Radio" to "无线电",
    "Radio PHY" to "无线电 PHY",
    "Radio kind" to "设备类型",
    "Radios" to "设备",
    "Radios marked Mine stay off Live. The sit and Debrief still have them. Moving with you leaves this on." to "标记为“我的”的设备不出现在实时页。记录和复盘中仍保留。“与你同行”开启期间本项保持开启。",
    "Radios you hear are pinned at this phone’s GPS, at the loudest point, and labeled (here)." to "听到的设备会钉在本手机 GPS 位置中信号最响的一点，并标注（此处）。",
    "Raw" to "原始",
    "Raw advertisement" to "原始广播",
    "Reading log…" to "正在读取日志…",
    "Reading the log and re-matching the catalog…" to "正在读取日志并重新匹配目录…",
    "Red line also keeps the line for the 10 minutes after. The oval stops growing when the hit ends." to "红线在之后 10 分钟内仍保留。命中结束时椭圆停止扩展。",
    "Red on black so a dark sit stays dim. Phone brightness does not change." to "黑底红字，暗夜保持低亮度。手机亮度不变。",
    "Remote ID aircraft use the coordinates in the advertisement, and a pilot location is a second pin." to "Remote ID 飞机使用广播中的坐标，飞手位置是第二个标记。",
    "Remove" to "移除",
    "Remove decode map" to "移除解码映射",
    "Remove decode map?" to "移除解码映射？",
    "Removes every field and the Live code mark. Save after adding fields still keeps the map." to "移除所有字段和实时代码标记。添加字段后保存仍会保留映射。",
    "Removes saved sits from this phone. An open sit is not deleted. The log is unchanged." to "从本手机移除已存记录。进行中的记录不会被删除。日志不变。",
    "Removes the saved sit from this phone. The log is unchanged." to "从本手机移除该已存记录。日志不变。",
    "Rename" to "重命名",
    "Rename sit" to "重命名记录",
    "Replaces the stock catalog, colors, stock bookmarks, stock filters, and the default switches." to "替换内置目录、颜色、内置收藏、内置筛选和默认开关。",
    "Reports" to "报告",
    "Required. 16-bit (FEAA) or full UUID." to "必填。16 位 (FEAA) 或完整 UUID。",
    "Reset" to "重置",
    "Reset / clear log" to "重置 / 清空日志",
    "Reset filter" to "重置筛选",
    "Reset filter?" to "重置筛选？",
    "Reset seen" to "重置已见",
    "Reset this hunt" to "重置本次猎踪",
    "Restore" to "恢复",
    "Restore defaults?" to "恢复默认？",
    "Rotated files were deleted. New detections will start a fresh log." to "轮转文件已删除。新探测将写入全新日志。",
    "Rotating log" to "轮转日志",
    "Rules" to "规则",
    "Save" to "保存",
    "Save a second sit to compare. Start a sit, then end it. The last 15 minutes can be this sit." to "保存第二条记录以进行对比。开始并结束一条记录即可。最近 15 分钟也可作为一条记录。",
    "Save current as…" to "当前保存为…",
    "Save current as… keeps the filter you have now." to "“当前保存为…”会保留当前筛选。",
    "Save name" to "保存名称",
    "Save notes" to "保存笔记",
    "Save signatures to SD card / storage…" to "将签名保存到 SD 卡 / 存储…",
    "Save to SD card / storage…" to "保存到 SD 卡 / 存储…",
    "Saved" to "已保存",
    "Saving sit export…" to "正在保存记录导出…",
    "Says possible GPS interference, or possible GPS spoofing. It speaks again only when the level goes up. Uses the media volume. Separate from the watchlist Voice switch." to "播报“可能的 GPS 干扰”或“可能的 GPS 欺骗”。仅在级别升高时再次播报。使用媒体音量。与关注列表的“语音”开关相互独立。",
    "Scale" to "比例",
    "Scan, GPS, TAK." to "扫描、GPS、TAK。",
    "Scanning" to "扫描",
    "Second sit" to "第二条记录",
    "Security string" to "安全字符串",
    "Selected color" to "选中颜色",
    "Selected signatures" to "选定签名",
    "Sends map markers to ATAK, WinTAK, or iTAK." to "将地图标记发送到 ATAK、WinTAK 或 iTAK。",
    "Sensitivity" to "灵敏度",
    "Sequential MACs" to "连续 MAC",
    "Service IDs" to "服务 ID",
    "Service UUID" to "服务 UUID",
    "Service UUID (empty = any, contains)" to "服务 UUID（留空 = 任意，包含）",
    "Service data" to "服务数据",
    "Services it offers" to "提供的服务",
    "Session" to "会话",
    "Settings" to "设置",
    "Settings imported" to "设置已导入",
    "Settings saved" to "设置已保存",
    "Settings → Restore default signatures & presets brings deleted stock presets back." to "设置 → 恢复默认签名与预设 可找回已删除的内置预设。",
    "Share" to "分享",
    "Share as text" to "以文本分享",
    "Share, Save, and Reset / clear log are on the Reports tab." to "分享、保存和重置 / 清空日志位于“报告”标签页。",
    "Show Live tour" to "显示实时导览",
    "Show all" to "显示全部",
    "Show all radios" to "显示全部设备",
    "Show as" to "显示为",
    "Show only" to "仅显示",
    "Show only is already hiding unmatched radios. Turn Show only off to use this switch." to "“仅显示”已在隐藏未匹配设备。请先关闭“仅显示”再使用此开关。",
    "Show only selected signatures" to "仅显示选定签名",
    "Show scan options" to "显示扫描选项",
    "Show this value next to the signature name. Strong values use a heavier chip." to "在签名名称旁显示此值。强值使用更粗的筛选片。",
    "Show unmatched rotating BLE" to "显示未匹配的轮换 BLE",
    "Shows on radio detail for matching radios, and in Share / AI Export. Not Extra attention — no Live “!” and not the amber card." to "匹配设备会在详情和分享 / AI 导出中显示。不属于“额外关注” — 实时页无“!”、无琥珀色卡片。",
    "Shows the Live tour again: display, pause, filters, signatures, reports, and settings." to "重新显示实时导览：显示、暂停、筛选、签名、报告和设置。",
    "Signal" to "信号",
    "Signal changed." to "信号已变化。",
    "Signal trend" to "信号趋势",
    "Signature candidates" to "签名候选",
    "Signature classes" to "签名类别",
    "Signature decoding skipped" to "已跳过签名解码",
    "Signature family" to "签名家族",
    "Signature names" to "签名名称",
    "Signatures" to "签名",
    "Signatures and filters you added are deleted. Export those first if you want a backup." to "你添加的签名和筛选会被删除。如需备份请先导出。",
    "Signatures first" to "签名优先",
    "Signatures imported" to "签名已导入",
    "Signatures only (hide unmatched)" to "仅签名（隐藏未匹配）",
    "Signatures only or Show only is also on, so unmatched radios stay hidden." to "“仅签名”或“仅显示”已开启，未匹配设备保持隐藏。",
    "Signatures saved" to "签名已保存",
    "Signatures still match. Install a newer APK to decode those fields." to "签名仍匹配。安装新版 APK 可解码这些字段。",
    "Sit compare" to "记录对比",
    "Sit compare AI Export" to "记录对比 AI 导出",
    "Sit compare PDF" to "记录对比 PDF",
    "Sit export" to "记录导出",
    "Sit report" to "记录报告",
    "Sits" to "记录",
    "Skipped" to "已跳过",
    "Some signature field maps in this catalog need a newer Fieldwatch." to "此目录中的部分签名字段映射需要新版 Fieldwatch。",
    "Sort" to "排序",
    "Source" to "来源",
    "Speaks the watch on the same volume as the beep. You can use the beep, the voice, or both. A second hit is skipped if Fieldwatch is already speaking. With no speech engine, the beep still plays if Beep is on." to "以与提示音相同的音量播报关注项。提示音和语音可任选或同用。正在播报时会跳过第二条命中。无语音引擎时，若“提示音”开启仍会响铃。",
    "Spoofing checks" to "欺骗检查",
    "Stamps this phone’s position on each detection: Live detail, Moving with you, Debrief, and new log rows." to "为每个探测记录本手机位置：实时详情、与你同行、复盘和新日志行。",
    "Stand outside, hold still, and stay away from a router. This takes about a minute." to "到室外、保持静止、远离路由器。大约需要一分钟。",
    "Start over" to "重新开始",
    "Start sit" to "开始记录",
    "Stock colors are by class (red pentest, amber cameras/ALPR, purple phones/tags, cyan wearables, green mesh, orange audio/glasses, teal in-car/vehicle). Change any row." to "内置颜色按类别区分（红=渗透测试，琥珀=摄像头/车牌识别，紫=手机/标签，青=穿戴设备，绿=Mesh，橙=音频/眼镜，蓝绿=车载/车辆）。可修改任意一行。",
    "Stop calibration" to "停止校准",
    "Strong" to "强",
    "Strongest (avg 30s)" to "最强（30 秒均值）",
    "Strongest signal" to "最强信号",
    "Subtitle line" to "副标题行",
    "Supported rates" to "支持速率",
    "System default" to "跟随系统",
    "System notification" to "系统通知",
    "Tag detections with GPS" to "GPS 标记探测",
    "Tap a class to open it. Live keeps radios that match a signature you turn on. An empty list leaves Live unchanged. Your picks stay if you turn this off and back on." to "点按类别展开。实时页会保留与你开启的签名匹配的设备。列表为空时实时页不变。关闭再开启后你的选择仍保留。",
    "Tap a class to open it. Radios that match a signature you turn on stay off Live. Your picks stay if you turn this off and back on." to "点按类别打开。开启的签名所匹配的设备不会出现在实时页。关闭再开启后你的选择仍保留。",
    "Tap a class to open its signatures. Bookmark = beep. Hide a family on Filters, not here." to "点按类别查看其签名。收藏 = 提示音。隐藏家族请在“筛选”中操作，而非此处。",
    "Tap a number for the radios there. Tap one icon for that radio. Tap a row to open it. Tap a red diamond for that detection." to "点按数字查看对应设备。点按图标查看该设备。点按行打开详情。点按红色菱形查看该探测。",
    "Tap a preset to replace the whole filter. Long-press one to delete it." to "点按预设替换整个筛选。长按可删除。",
    "Tap the Moving with you preset to test BLE, or turn off Signatures only / Show only / Named radios only / Watched only." to "点按“与你同行”预设测试 BLE，或关闭 仅签名 / 仅显示 / 仅已命名设备 / 仅关注。",
    "Tap to edit. Bookmark = beep when that family appears. Hide a family on Filters, not here." to "点按编辑。收藏 = 该家族出现时提示音。隐藏家族请在“筛选”中操作。",
    "Test alert" to "测试警报",
    "That is where you were, not a location from the other radio." to "那是你所在的位置，并非来自对方设备。",
    "The file on disk is one detection per line. CSV is those rows in a spreadsheet. GPX, KML, and WiGLE are points where this phone was when it heard each radio, not a location from the other radio. Tag detections with GPS and logging both have to be on. Share uses the Android share sheet. Fieldwatch does not upload." to "磁盘上的文件每行一条探测。CSV 是这些行组成的表格。GPX、KML 和 WiGLE 记录的是本手机听到各设备时所在的位置，并非对方设备的位置。需同时开启“GPS 标记探测”和日志。分享使用 Android 分享面板。Fieldwatch 不上传任何数据。",
    "The file on disk is one detection per line. Reports → Log can share or save CSV, JSON, GPX, KML, or WiGLE." to "磁盘上的文件每行一条探测。报告 → 日志 可分享或保存 CSV、JSON、GPX、KML 或 WiGLE 格式。",
    "The file was written to the folder you picked. In the system picker, use the menu to choose the SD card if you want it off internal storage." to "文件已写入所选文件夹。如需存到 SD 卡而非内部存储，请在系统选择器的菜单中选择 SD 卡。",
    "The mark does not say where the cause is." to "标记不表示成因所在位置。",
    "The note does not say it was one radio, and it does not name a tool. This phone needs a GPS fix." to "备注不表示单一设备，也不指明工具。本手机需要 GPS 定位。",
    "The pack was written to the folder you picked. Keep it for a factory reset or a new phone. Import settings on the new install. Signatures are a separate pack." to "配置包已写入所选文件夹。请妥善保存，用于恢复出厂或换机。新安装上使用“导入设置”。签名是单独的包。",
    "The pack was written to the folder you picked. Share it with another Fieldwatch or keep it as a backup before Restore defaults." to "配置包已写入所选文件夹。可分享给其他 Fieldwatch，或在恢复默认前留作备份。",
    "The popup, red line, beep, and voice start at this level. A weaker hit still shows in Diagnostics and in the sit report." to "弹窗、红线、提示音和语音从此级别开始。较弱的命中仍显示在诊断和记录报告中。",
    "The result stays on this phone until you calibrate again. It is not part of Export settings." to "结果保留在本手机直至下次校准。不包含在“导出设置”中。",
    "The same pip as a watchlist hit, on the media volume. The popup and the red line still show if this is off." to "与关注列表命中相同的提示音，使用媒体音量。关闭时弹窗和红线仍显示。",
    "The same report as text or PDF. Radios only in this sit, only in the second, and in both. Extra attention and named radios are marked. These points are where this phone was, not a location from the other radio." to "以文本或 PDF 输出同样的报告：仅此记录有、仅第二条记录有、以及两者都有的设备。“额外关注”和已命名设备会标注。这些点是你所在的位置，并非对方设备的位置。",
    "The screen stays awake while Fieldwatch is open, so Bluetooth keeps scanning. The scan still runs from the notification if you leave the app. Turn this off when you pocket the phone." to "Fieldwatch 打开期间屏幕保持常亮，蓝牙得以持续扫描。离开应用后扫描仍由通知栏进程继续。放进口袋时请关闭此开关。",
    "The time starts at the last update. Until deleted stays until GNSS is set to Off." to "时长从最后一次更新算起。“直到删除”会保留至 GNSS 设为关闭。",
    "This cannot be undone." to "此操作无法撤销。",
    "This does not change the red line on Live. A store full of radios advertising pairing can cause this." to "这不影响实时页红线。商店内大量配对广播设备可能触发此情况。",
    "This is not direction finding. Privacy mode pauses the feed." to "这不是测向。隐私模式会暂停数据流。",
    "This opens Developer options. Turn Wi-Fi scan throttling off. Fieldwatch matches that switch when you come back." to "打开开发者选项。关闭 Wi-Fi 扫描节流。返回后 Fieldwatch 会同步该开关。",
    "This opens Developer options. Turn Wi-Fi scan throttling on to use the normal wait. Fieldwatch matches that switch when you come back." to "打开开发者选项。开启 Wi-Fi 扫描节流以使用正常等待。返回后 Fieldwatch 会同步该开关。",
    "This opens Fieldwatch’s battery page. Turn on Allow background usage. Fieldwatch matches it when you come back." to "打开 Fieldwatch 的电池页面。开启“允许后台运行”。返回后 Fieldwatch 会同步。",
    "This phone" to "本手机",
    "This phone is older than Android 11, so Fieldwatch cannot tell if Wi-Fi scan throttling is on. Faster scanning stays off." to "此手机低于 Android 11，Fieldwatch 无法判断 Wi-Fi 扫描节流是否开启。加速扫描保持关闭。",
    "This phone is older than Android 11, so Fieldwatch cannot tell if Wi-Fi scan throttling is on. The switch stays off." to "此手机低于 Android 11，Fieldwatch 无法判断 Wi-Fi 扫描节流是否开启。开关保持关闭。",
    "This phone needs a GPS fix." to "本手机需要 GPS 定位。",
    "This phone’s Fieldwatch marker stays for about 2 minutes." to "本手机的 Fieldwatch 标记保留约 2 分钟。",
    "This phone’s IPv4  ·  none" to "本手机 IPv4  ·  无",
    "This shows loud Bluetooth radios that stay with you. Wi-Fi access points stay off." to "显示一直伴随你的响亮蓝牙设备。Wi-Fi 热点不显示。",
    "This signature has a decode map, but this advertisement has no manufacturer or service payload to parse." to "此签名有解码映射，但此广播没有可解析的厂商或服务载荷。",
    "This signature has a decode map, but this advertisement has no manufacturer or service payload to parse. Many Govee lights only broadcast a name." to "此签名有解码映射，但此广播没有可解析的厂商或服务载荷。许多 Govee 灯只广播名称。",
    "This sit: the last 15 minutes still in memory, about 400 radios. Same window as Debrief." to "此记录：内存中最近 15 分钟，约 400 台设备。与复盘同一时间窗。",
    "Title line" to "标题行",
    "Turn on" to "开启",
    "Turn on Tag detections with GPS and walk, or pick a sit that recorded a path." to "开启“GPS 标记探测”并走动，或选择一条有路径的记录。",
    "Turn on Tag detections with GPS to record a path." to "开启“GPS 标记探测”以记录路径。",
    "Turn on Tag detections with GPS, then walk or drive." to "开启“GPS 标记探测”，然后步行或驾车。",
    "Turn on any combination. Extra attention sends body cameras, glasses, recorders, pentest gear, and public-safety access points." to "可任意组合开启。“额外关注”上报执法记录仪、智能眼镜、录音设备、渗透测试设备和公共安全热点。",
    "Turn this off to keep your position out of the logs." to "关闭后日志不记录你的位置。",
    "Turn this off to leave streets and the map out." to "关闭后不含街道和地图。",
    "Turning this on clears the other “only” filters, except Hide these." to "开启会清除其他“仅显示”类筛选，“隐藏这些”除外。",
    "Type" to "类型",
    "Unit" to "单位",
    "Unknown IEEE OUI" to "未知 IEEE OUI",
    "Unlisted Appearance 0x%04X" to "未列出的外观 0x%04X",
    "Unmatched" to "未匹配",
    "Unmatched radios are never sent. A pin needs coordinates, from the advertisement or from Tag detections with GPS." to "未匹配设备不会发送。标记需要坐标，来自广播或“GPS 标记探测”。",
    "Unmatched radios in the log that share an id. Not every unknown radio. Nothing is added until you save it." to "日志中共享同一 ID 的未匹配设备。并非所有未知设备。保存前不会添加任何内容。",
    "Unrestricted battery" to "不受限制的电池",
    "Until deleted stays until the feed is turned off." to "“直到删除”在数据流关闭前一直保留。",
    "Updating stock catalog…" to "正在更新内置目录…",
    "Use high-accuracy location, or the path stays empty." to "请使用高精度定位，否则路径为空。",
    "Use that to mute noisy OUIs or names on one signature without deleting them." to "用于在不删除的情况下屏蔽某签名下嘈杂的 OUI 或名称。",
    "Uses what is still in memory, not a saved sit." to "使用内存中尚存的数据，而非已存记录。",
    "Value" to "值",
    "Vendor IE OUI" to "厂商 IE OUI",
    "Vendor contains" to "厂商包含",
    "Vibrate" to "振动",
    "View" to "查看",
    "Voice" to "语音",
    "Voice on watched signature" to "关注签名语音",
    "Waiting for a new Wi-Fi or BLE radio. It stays while we hear it, then at least as long as Brief hold after the last packet." to "等待新的 Wi-Fi 或 BLE 设备。侦听期间保留，最后一个信号包后再保留至少“短暂保留”时长。",
    "Walk with that on. The path needs a GPS fix." to "开启后走动。路径需要 GPS 定位。",
    "Walking away does not move the pin. A louder detection does." to "走开不会移动标记，更响的探测才会。",
    "Watch" to "关注",
    "Watched only" to "仅显示关注",
    "Watched only is also on, so unwatched radios stay hidden." to "“仅显示关注”也已开启，未关注设备保持隐藏。",
    "Watches for gain falling while the signal holds or rises. A clock or position mismatch counts with that, or with another mismatch. One mismatch alone does not warn. A careful spoofer can still get past these checks." to "监测信号持稳或增强时增益反而下降的情况。时钟或位置不匹配会与此叠加，或与其他不匹配叠加。单一不匹配不会告警。精心伪装的欺骗仍可能绕过这些检查。",
    "Watches for satellites fading at the same time. A hand, a pocket, or getting in a car can do that. Leave this off unless you are testing it." to "监测卫星是否同时衰落。用手捂住、放进口袋或上车都可能触发。除非在测试，否则保持关闭。",
    "Watchlist" to "关注列表",
    "Watchlist alerts" to "关注列表警报",
    "Watchlist sends bookmarked signatures and named radios with Alert on." to "关注列表发送收藏的签名和已开启警报的命名设备。",
    "What it says it is (Appearance)" to "自报身份（外观）",
    "What this looks like" to "外观判断",
    "What to check" to "检查什么",
    "What to say" to "说什么",
    "What to send" to "发送什么",
    "When" to "时间",
    "While on, this radio stays listed and does not beep." to "开启期间该设备保持列出且不提示音。",
    "Who is shown." to "显示谁。",
    "Who made it" to "谁制造的",
